{"availability":"available","full":"Techspell01/voc","name":"voc","description":"Speak in Malayalam or Manglish: get an English email, a live-writing sticky note, or your to-dos, dates and shop orders. React PWA + Vercel.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T19:13:37Z","updated":"2026-10-14T17:39:12Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://usevoc.vercel.app","topics":["gemini","malayalam","manglish","mcp","pwa","react","speech-to-text","vercel"],"demo":"https://usevoc.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:50.079Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:50.079Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:50.079Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.529Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:08.937Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:52:50.079Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Speak in Malayalam. Get an English email, a sticky note, or your lists and dates. Live:","In Kerala, voice notes run everything: a customer's order to the kirana shop, Amma's list for the way home, a boss's instructions. They come in Manglish, Malayalam and English mixed mid-sentence, and someone has to listen and write it all down. Voc (short for voice) does that:","\"Chetta, randu kilo ari, arakilo cheriya ulli, pathu mutta venam. Nale raavile ethikkanam. Pinne velliyazhcha 5 manikku Ammede doctor appointment und.\""],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ea12c0bdb475bf8905ab4af5a2e5a29f80a18a3c029f4a240d17f217b28cd1d4","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.095Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.095Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Speak in Malayalam. Get an English email, a sticky note, or your lists and dates. Live:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Zepto and Swiggy Instamart go further, through their official MCP servers: sign in once on their own page (phone + OTP) and Voc puts every item in that account's cart (an AI agent picks the best match and pack count), then you open the app and pay.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Notes, to-dos and orders stay in the phone's storage; there is no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ea12c0bdb475bf8905ab4af5a2e5a29f80a18a3c029f4a240d17f217b28cd1d4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.095Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T15:40:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.096Z","hash":"ea12c0bdb475bf8905ab4af5a2e5a29f80a18a3c029f4a240d17f217b28cd1d4","originalBytes":11682,"storedBytes":11682,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:08.937Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Browser extensions & PWAs"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Productivity","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Browser extensions & PWAs"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"mcp"},{"subject":"Browser extensions & PWAs","source":"metadata","match":"PWA"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Android","Mobile","Image, audio & video AI"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://usevoc.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T19:10:40.364Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:10:40.364Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T19:10:40.364Z","target":"https://usevoc.vercel.app/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-24T19:10:40.364Z"},"prev